Author: Van Tran <940988+vantt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Fri Jul 17 08:07:26 2026 +0700

    feat(discovery-context-1): thread description + gate/discovery history into clarify prompt
    
    submit now persists the full submitted text as work.description (optional
    additive field). judgeDiscovery/buildDiscoveryPrompt take an optional `view`
    param so the clarify-loop prompt carries the description, the latest
    ask/answer pair, and prior verdicts instead of only title/kind/refs/deps —
    fixing the run-1 dogfood gap where a person's answer was never seen by the
    next judge pass. Old 2-arg calls keep working; work.add's fold already
    spreads the payload so description survives rebuild with no replay.mjs edit.

